{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Ooggetuigen van het Scholtenhuis, interview 05"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41062"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Oorlogs- en Verzetscentrum Groningen (OVCG)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"A.J.  Jongejan"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ovcg"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>De heer Edskes was in 1944 als zeventienjarige in dienst bij de rechtbank in Groningen. Hij bracht en haalde regelmatig verkeerd bezorgde post in Scholtenhuis. Ook werd hij eenmaal een middag ondervraagd over zijn identiteit, terwijl hij onbewust een pakketje met een dienstpistool op zak had. Dit pakketje had hij gekregen van een collega en dit is niet ontdekt.<br><br>00:03:04 Verzet op de rechtbank<br><br>00:04:15 Post bezorgen en halen op Scholtenhuis<br><br>00:13:30 Razzia in Boteringestraat: alle mannen boven de achttien moeten zich melden. Edskes blijft als zeventienjarige binnen<br><br>00:16:30 Krijgt pakje van zojuist meegevoerde collega<br><br>00:18:05 Grüne Polizei neemt ook Edskes mee<\/p><p>00:20:52 In het Scholtenhuis: ondervraging, wachten, nogmaals ondervraging en wachten<br><br>00:22:50 Vrijgelaten. Bekijkt inhoud pakje, hierin zit een pistool<br><br>00:28:20 Interieur kamer waarin ondervraging plaatsvond<br><br>00:32:20 Wat als Edskes had geweten dat hij een pistool op zak had<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2010-03-29"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Rechtbank"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Scholtenhuis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"postbezorging"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"wapenbezit"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"razzia"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ondervraging"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"persoonscontrole"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oral history"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2008-12-17"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Monique Brinks (interviewer)"}}